## Branch purpose

Add an EIP-8182-conformant sponge wrapper over the upstream
Poseidon2-BN254-t4 permutation primitive — exposing the `IPoseidon2`
interface (`hash(left, right)` + `hashN(bytes32[] calldata)`) with
length-tagged IV, domain-tag-as-input-0 prepending, and canonical-input
rejection.

Generic improvements only; **no consumer-specific code in this branch**
(the motivating consumer is the iso20022-gateway ConfidentialOmnibusVault
contract, but all changes here are upstream-compatible and could be
proposed back to zemse/poseidon2-evm).

